<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ ADRs weaker in late New York as Dow dips.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ ADRs weaker in late New York as Dow dips.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mostly weaker in late New York trade, where the Dow was down 7.66 points at 8190.79 at 7.30 a.m NZT (1930 GMT).</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and Australia.</p>
<p>Company		   Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 1/4	 -0/05  *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$34 1/8	 -0/03  *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$22/01	  -0/02  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13		nil   *</p>
<p>MAS Tech     NASDAQ   US23	     -0 1/8</p>
<p>Tranz Rail   N.Y.    US$16/15	  +0/01  *</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.56		+2</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$2.06		+4</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.11	     nil</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading  </p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
